<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-SRI LANKA DISMISS ZIMBABWE FOR 141.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA DISMISS ZIMBABWE FOR 141.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka dismissed Zimbabwe for 141 in their first innings on the first day of the second test on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
